I've lost my video editing mojo lately. I've been concentrating on myself a little and totally loving life here in Dartmoor. Sometimes you have to prioritise yourself before anything else. This has been one of those moments. But rest assured, videos will come again soon I promise 😁

Enjoy the rest of your day folks. Peace ✌🏽💚🧡

